I shipped the **`VehiclePicker`** P4 Apple shared surface at full parity with `components/layout/VehiclePicker.tsx`, committed as `20c390b13`.

**Delivered** (`apps/apple/TeslaSync/shared-surfaces/VehiclePicker.*`, 7 files, +1385 lines):
