- **Model** binding the P1/S8 state-holder seam, P1/S11 `view.opened` telemetry, P1/S10 i18n facade, connection axis + stale auto-refresh
- **Views** + main surface rendering **every** state (loading/empty/error/single/ready/stale/offline — no hidden surfaces), native menu `Picker`, full VoiceOver/Dynamic Type
- **strings** (incl. the web key `vehiclePicker.aria`), **8 Previews**, **XCTest** suite
