**Verified (all green for the surface):** compiles on arm64-apple-macos15.0 (with/without DEBUG); **26/26 assertions pass executing the real Adapter/Model/Projection code**; swiftformat, swiftlint `--strict`, and the placeholder gate clean.

**Gate: `EXIT=1` / `STATUS=BLOCKED`** (honest log written). I built `Shared.xcframework` from the KMP core (12-min Gradle build) and ran the literal gate first-hand. Every failure is **external to this surface and out of scope**:
